<title>USA: Energy Search to study Dominion tract.</title>
<headline>Energy Search to study Dominion tract.</headline>
<dateline>JANE LEW, W.Va. 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Energy Search Inc said it will conduct limited geologic studies on a 3,700-acre oil and natural gas lease in Raleigh County, W.Va., under an agreement with Dominion Appalachian Development Inc which holds the lease.</p>
<p>Dominion Appalachian Development, a subsidiary of Richmond, Va.-based Dominion Resources Inc, is an oil and natural gas operating company active in West Virginia, Kentucky, Ohio and Pennsylvania.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
